  "prompts": {
    "locomotion": "Production pixel-art animation sheet of selected B DOLL HEAD spider from reference BOTTOM ROW ONLY. Preserve near-black eight hooked legs, tiny pale eyes, tall organic chitin-rib cage abdomen containing THREE cracked porcelain DOLL HEADS, no skulls, no whole dolls or toy limbs. EXACT1536x1024,3columns2rows,512squarecells. SIX ceiling locomotion poses rowmajor: idle, stepA, passingA, stepB, passingB, settledidle. All face RIGHT threequarter side view, cage above small head. Each complete silhouette within local x64..448,y48..480. Ceiling contact at y48, upperfeet visibly hook imaginary ceiling; body below. Body center local256,280. Same identity/scale allsix, alternate ceiling supporting legs with bent raised stepping legs, front legs below reaching forward. No wings. Four upper hooked feet and four lower articulated legs, exactlyeight. Broad pale dollheads readable through widely spaced ribs. Entire pose fits cell withclear gutters. Genuine transparent background, no haze, no floor/ceiling, no text/grid, no web strand across cells. Clean sprite production source, not poster. Reference used only for identity; convert frontview to slightly right-facing side view without losing cage faces.",
    "action": "Create second production animation sprite sheet for EXACT same doll-head cage spider as reference. Preserve FOUR visible porcelain doll heads identities in organic black cage and body scale; no whole dolls/skulls/wings.1536x1024 exact3columns2rows512cells, transparent no haze. Source facesRIGHT. Entire silhouette eachcell x48..464 y48..480, upper hooked feet at ceilingy48. TOP ROW poses:1 aim/windup head turned slightlyright, front legs cocked;2 webfire mouthopen fangs apart frontlegs extendingRIGHT;3 recover frontlegs lowering. BOTTOM ROW THREE DISTINCT HAUL poses: rear/side lowerleg pair reaches DOWN AND RIGHT to grasp invisible taut silk at local(380,420); nextpose thoselegs bent drawing grip back towardbody at(300,380); thirdpose resets oneleg forward while otherholds at(340,400). Frontmost pair stretches toward preyRIGHT in allhaulposes. Fourupperlegs gripceiling, lowerfourlegs dohaul/reach. SHOW strong smooth successive limb changes, connectedanatomy, believable joints, samebodyregistration. NO silk strands baked in, runtime draws thread separately. Keep uniform scale same as reference with bodycenter256,280 and cagebelowceiling. Crisp pixelart. No floor orenvironment text labels grid. Six full figures.",
    "reactions": "Production sprite sheet same exact doll-head cage spider reference, four porcelain dollheads inside black organic ribbed abdomen, eight legs, right facing.1536x1024 3columns2rows512cells. TOP ROW: catch reaction frontlegs brace, escape reaction arms recoil when silkbreaks, hurt flinch bodytilts slightly. BOTTOM ROW THREE sequential DEATH poses: ceilinghooks release andlegs curl; falling body rotates slightly withlooselycurledlegs andcagecracks; collapsed curledlegs undercage withbroken porcelain dollhead fragments. Inanimate porcelain only, no blood or organs. Preserve scale and recognizable body/head, keep complete silhouettes insidecells with48px gutters. Living topframes ceilingcontacty48 andbodycenter256,280. Death completebody staysinsidecell, no clipping, no flyingfragments crossingcells. No silk baked, no backdrop floor text labels. Genuine transparent background no haze. Pixelart consistent with reference, notpaintedconcept. Six visuallydistinct readableposes, no extra limbs."
  }
